DB01222	Budesonide	approved	5281004	-	"Budesonide extended release capsules are indicated for the treatment and maintenance of mild to moderate Crohn?s disease.[L10601,L10604] Various inhaled budesonide products are indicated for prophylactic therapy in asthma[L10607,L10613,L10619] and reducing exacerbations of COPD.[L10619] A budesonide nasal spray is available over the counter for symptoms of hay fever and upper respiratory allergies.[L10616] Extended release capsules are indicated to induce remission of mild to moderate ulcerative colitis[L10622] and a rectal foam is used for mild to moderate distal ulcerative colitis.[L10625]"	P04150; P04083; P08235; P06401; P01579; P05113	0.428812238584	17-88
